cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its scenarios or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Local steering for rigid multi-robot payload transport in dynamic warehouses: a replicated benchmark and a learned-occupancy hybrid (PA-VFH)"
type: software
# TODO(authors): replace the placeholder below with every author (family-names,
# given-names, affiliation, orcid) before tagging the release.
authors:
